{
  "file_id": "3582",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 88,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "We're finally at Spiral Mountain.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8584,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Por fin, la Montaña Espiral."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "MetalSeadramon, Puppetmon, and\nMugendramon...",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8618,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "MetalSeadramon, Puppetmon\ny Machinedramon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "We wouldn't have been able to\ndefeat them alone.",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8666,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "No habríamos podido\nderrotarlos solos."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "That's right. We were helped by so\nmany other Digimon...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8715,
      "_bytes": 56,
      "translation": "Así es. Nos ayudaron tantos\notros Digimon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "But...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8772,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "Pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "We won't be able to defeat Piemon\nif we can't all get back together\nagain...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8779,
      "_bytes": 76,
      "translation": "No podremos vencer a Piedmon\nsi no volvemos a estar\ntodos juntos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Tai...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8856,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Tai..."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Ah, don't worry about it. Come on,\nlet's hurry to the top!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8866,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "No te preocupes. ¡Venga, vamos\ndeprisa hacia la cima!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Tai! What's that?",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8925,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Tai! ¿Qué es eso?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Remember what Chuumon said?",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8946,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¿Recuerdas qué dijo Chuumon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "The Dark Masters live on top of\nSpiral Mountain.",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8974,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "Los Amos Oscuros viven en la\nMontaña Espiral."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "So then that thing up there...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9023,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "Entonces eso de ahí arriba..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "That's where they live, right?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9054,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "Ahí es donde viven, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "That's where they live, right?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9085,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "Ahí es donde viven, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Someone's coming!",
      "speaker_id": 4021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9116,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Viene alguien!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9134,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¿Eh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Oh hoh hoh! Welcome, my adorable\nlittle children!",
      "speaker_id": 4471,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9139,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¡Oh jo jo! ¡Bienvenidos, mis\nadorables pequeños!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "This Digimon gives me the creeps!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9189,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡Este Digimon me da mal rollo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "That's one of the Nightmare\nSoldiers.",
      "speaker_id": 4021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9223,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "Es uno de los Soldados\nde la Pesadilla."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "You're tired, aren't you? Then\nI'll let you sleep... for\neternity!",
      "speaker_id": 4471,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9261,
      "_bytes": 66,
      "translation": "Estáis cansados, ¿no? ¡Pues os\ndejaré dormir... por toda\nla eternidad!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "L-Lord Piemon!",
      "speaker_id": 4471,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9328,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¡Señor Piedmon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "We did it!",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9343,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Ya está!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Hahaha...",
      "speaker_id": 3081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9354,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Jajaja..."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Piemon...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9364,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Piedmon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "The final Dark Master...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9374,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "El último Amo Oscuro..."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Sora, I need you to do something\nfor me, and you're the only one\nwho can do it.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9399,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "Sora, necesito que hagas algo\npor mí, y eres la única que\npuede hacerlo."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Huh?!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9479,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡¿Eh?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Go find Matt! And take T.K\nwith you!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9485,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¡Ve a buscar a Matt! ¡Y llévate\na T.K.!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "But Piemon's right here!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9527,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "¡Pero Piedmon está aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Piemon's the last Dark Master, and\nhe's probably ridiculously\nstrong...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9552,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "Piedmon es el último Amo Oscuro,\ny seguro que es increíblemente\nfuerte..."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "There's no way we're going to beat\nhim unless all of us work\ntogether!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9624,
      "_bytes": 70,
      "translation": "¡No hay forma de vencerlo si no\ntrabajamos todos juntos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Tai's right.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9695,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "Tai tiene razón."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Tai...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9711,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Tai..."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "It's just like soccer.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9721,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "Es como el fútbol."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9744,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¿Eh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "After Matt and Mimi left us, I\nrealized...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9749,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "Cuando Matt y Mimi se fueron,\nme di cuenta..."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "We can't keep charging in like\nthis. I don't want there to be any\nmore sacrifices.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9794,
      "_bytes": 82,
      "translation": "No podemos seguir lanzándonos\nasí sin más. No quiero que haya\nmás sacrificios."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Tai... I'll make sure to tell\nthem that!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9877,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "Tai... ¡Me aseguraré de\ndecírselo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Good! Now hurry!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9921,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡Bien! ¡Corre!"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "T.K!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9938,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡T.K.!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Let's go, Sora!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9946,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Vamos, Sora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Hahaha...",
      "speaker_id": 3081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9962,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Jajaja..."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "I'm counting on you, Agumon!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9972,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Cuento contigo, Agumon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Okay, Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10001,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Vale, Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Watch out! He's a tough one!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10015,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Cuidado! ¡Este es duro!"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "We're almost at the top. We'll\ntake our last break.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10044,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "Ya casi llegamos arriba.\nHaremos el último descanso."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Okay! Time to get moving!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10096,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Vale! ¡A moverse!"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10122,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "We've gone through a lot to get\nhere, haven't we?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10128,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "Hemos pasado por mucho para\nllegar aquí, ¿verdad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10178,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "Sí..."
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "I'm really glad I'm here with you\nguys.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10186,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "Me alegro de estar aquí\ncon vosotros."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10226,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Hey, Tai, I wonder if we'll\never see the others again...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10230,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "Oye, Tai, me pregunto si\nvolveremos a ver a los demás..."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "I don't know.",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10290,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "No lo sé."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Of course we will!",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10304,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Claro que sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Tai...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10323,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Tai..."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "We'll do everything we can. We'll\nhave to make up for everyone who's\nnot here, too.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10333,
      "_bytes": 83,
      "translation": "Haremos todo lo que podamos.\nTenemos que suplir a los\nque no están aquí."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Yeah... you're right.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10417,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Sí... tienes razón."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "We've been separated multiple\ntimes, and we've always managed to\nget together again.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10439,
      "_bytes": 84,
      "translation": "Nos hemos separado muchas\nveces, pero siempre logramos\nvolver a reunirnos."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Yeah, you're right.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10524,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Sí, tienes razón."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "We'll do everything we can. We'll\nhave to make up for everyone who's\nnot here, too.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10544,
      "_bytes": 83,
      "translation": "Haremos todo lo que podamos.\nTenemos que suplir a los\nque no están aquí."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10628,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "I'll do it! I'll do whatever I can\ndo!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10634,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡Lo haré! ¡Haré lo que pueda!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "We won't be able to defeat Piemon\nlike this.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10673,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "Así no podremos vencer a\nPiedmon."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Izzy!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10718,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Izzy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "I think so, too. Unless we get all\nthe Chosen Children back together,\nwe're going to lose.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10729,
      "_bytes": 90,
      "translation": "Yo también lo creo. Si no\nreunimos a todos los Niños\nElegidos, perderemos."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "So you've realized... the only\nreason we've been able to get this\nfar is because of your strategies.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10820,
      "_bytes": 100,
      "translation": "Así que te has dado cuenta...\nSolo hemos llegado tan lejos\ngracias a tus estrategias."
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Not really strategy, more like\njust the stuff I think up...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10921,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "No son estrategias, más bien\nson cosas que se me ocurren..."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "I trust you, Tai.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10981,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "Confío en ti, Tai."
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Izzy...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11002,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "Izzy..."
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "I believe in you, Tai.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11015,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "Creo en ti, Tai."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "I wonder if Matt will come...",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11041,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "Me pregunto si Matt vendrá..."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Whenever I was getting all\nself-centered, Matt acted in \neveryone's best interest.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11073,
      "_bytes": 84,
      "translation": "Cuando yo me ponía muy egoísta,\nMatt pensaba en lo mejor\npara todos."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "You two were always fighting, even\nfrom the start.",
      "speaker_id": 2721,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11158,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "Vosotros discutíais siempre,\ndesde el principio."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11209,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "Sí..."
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "So there's no need to worry! He's\nnot the kind of guy who'd abandon\nhis friends!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11217,
      "_bytes": 80,
      "translation": "¡Así que no hay que preocuparse!\n¡Él no es de los que abandonan\na sus amigos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "That's right! I trust Matt!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11298,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¡Así es! ¡Confío en Matt!"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "I trust Matt!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11328,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Confío en Matt!"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Are you scared, Kari?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11344,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¿Tienes miedo, Kari?"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "No. I was scared when Myotismon\nwas there, and I couldn't do\nanything...",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11368,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "No. Tenía miedo cuando estaba\nMyotismon, y no podía hacer\nnada..."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "But now, Tailmon's with me.",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11440,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "Pero ahora tengo a Gatomon."
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "I'll protect Kari!",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11468,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Protegeré a Kari!"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "I wonder where Matt and the\nothers went?",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11489,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "¿Dónde estarán Matt y\nlos demás?"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "I trust Matt.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11532,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "Confío en Matt."
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "If that's what you think, then\nI'll trust him, too!",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11548,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "¡Si tú lo crees, entonces yo\ntambién confío en él!"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "I trust Matt, too!",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11600,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Yo también confío!"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Time to get moving",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11621,
      "_bytes": 18,
